Production deploys from main are on hold.

main carries dev's code, but production isn't set up for it yet: the production API and apps are
configured for Base mainnet, the new contracts aren't deployed there, and the production
environment lacks the settings dev's code reads.

While this file exists:
- Vercel skips production builds from main (scripts/vercel-ignore.sh, rule 0) for the member app,
  merchant, pay, rewards and command. Docs builds production from dev and isn't affected.
- Railway's production API has no deploy trigger on main, so it keeps running what it ran.

To release production: set up the production environment, restore Railway's deploy trigger on
main, and delete this file in a pull request.
